<title>NEW ZEALAND: Official segment indicators from NZ wool sale.</title>
<headline>Official segment indicators from NZ wool sale.</headline>
<dateline>WELLINGTON 1996-09-23</dateline>
<text>
<p>The official market indicator from Friday's Christchurch wool sale was 471 NZ cents per kg clean, down from 476 NZ cents at the last sale, Wools of New Zealand said on Monday.</p>
<p>Official segment indicators (in cents per kg clean) compared with the last sale were:</p>
<p>Group</p>
<p>    Fine	  18/24 micron - 851 vs 890</p>
<p>    Medium	25/31 micron - 499 vs 502</p>
<p>    Strong	32/41 micron - 432 vs 433</p>
<p>    Lambs			  - nil vs nil</p>
<p>--Wellington Newsroom (64 4) 4734746</p>
